  "prefLabel": "He-P 805.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 805.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to set forth the classification of and licensing requirements for supported residential health care facilities (SRHCF) pursuant to RSA 151:2, I(e)(2) and as described in RSA 151:9, VII(a)(2).\n\nSource. #2261, eff 1-17-83; ss by #3193, eff 1-28-86; ss by #5317, EMERGENCY, eff 1-29-92, EXPIRED: 5-28-92\n\nNew. #5513, eff 11-25-92; ss by #5665, eff 7-14-93, EXPIRED: 7-14-99\n\nNew. #8746, eff 10-25-06; ss by #10813, eff 4-21-15; ss by #14358, eff 8-28-25, EXPIRES: 8-28-35",
